# Ethio Techbridge Academy - Client Environment Configuration

# In local development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# In Vercel production:
# Set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel Project Dashboard to point to your deployed backend:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-domain.com/api

# Official Public Google Forms Registration URL:
# Must be a public responder link (/viewform or forms.gle), never an /edit link.
# When provided, registration CTAs will provide direct access to the official form.
# Example:
# VITE_GOOGLE_FORM_URL=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc.../viewform
